(7712445, 1267511, 50695, '<td valign="top">this has a mood. it is a coherent piece of art. The texture of the owl seems to have blown apart and formed the texture of the tree he is perched on. The black and white processing is essential to this effect. Well done.</td>', 'this has a mood. it is a coherent piece of art. The texture of the owl seems to have blown apart and formed the texture of the tree he is perched on. The black and white processing is essential to this effect. Well done.', '2022-01-22 10:26:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7712446, 1267485, 173844, '<td valign="top">Really?  I''m the first to comment on on this glorious, crystalline celebration?  Love the flowing composition and the stark contrast, with only the blown snow and the imagination interceding.  Very sharp; perhaps the clarity of high altitude.  Ancient.</td>', 'Really?  I''m the first to comment on on this glorious, crystalline celebration?  Love the flowing composition and the stark contrast, with only the blown snow and the imagination interceding.  Very sharp; perhaps the clarity of high altitude.  Ancient.', '2022-01-22 10:29:19.000000', NULL, 0),
