(7712454, 1267496, 173844, '<td valign="top">
Wonderfully engaging and clever.  The composition is built up, bottom to top, in measured fashion, an ascension.  The more somber tones nicely serve to bring out the red berries, the leaves and the rich brown.  Also the titmouse''s throat and eye patch.  Powerfully intimate.</td>', 'Wonderfully engaging and clever.  The composition is built up, bottom to top, in measured fashion, an ascension.  The more somber tones nicely serve to bring out the red berries, the leaves and the rich brown.  Also the titmouse''s throat and eye patch.  Powerfully intimate.', '2022-01-22 10:38:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7712456, 1267508, 173844, '<td valign="top">Quietly joyous.  Bison, inseparable from land, walking along on this mild winter day.  Strongly weighted composition.  The bushes/trees nicely dapple the scene.  The snow looks properly white, making a case for high key but for the palette reaching deeply into brown.  So, surprisingly warm.  Handsome, iconic.</td>', 'Quietly joyous.  Bison, inseparable from land, walking along on this mild winter day.  Strongly weighted composition.  The bushes/trees nicely dapple the scene.  The snow looks properly white, making a case for high key but for the palette reaching deeply into brown.  So, surprisingly warm.  Handsome, iconic.', '2022-01-22 10:52:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7712457, 1267463, 173844, '<td valign="top">The rich colors, amber and ultramarine, support the sense of fantasy.  At first this looked like a flight of hummingbirds, a happy mix-up.  Graphically superb.</td>', 'The rich colors, amber and ultramarine, support the sense of fantasy.  At first this looked like a flight of hummingbirds, a happy mix-up.  Graphically superb.', '2022-01-22 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7712458, 1267511, 173844, '<td valign="top">The optimal path, black and white.  The owl, in its placid finery, is a revelation.  And what a wonderful balance found in the owl and attending tree.  Not really stark, but beautiful in a stark way.  Yeah, stunning.</td>', 'The optimal path, black and white.  The owl, in its placid finery, is a revelation.  And what a wonderful balance found in the owl and attending tree.  Not really stark, but beautiful in a stark way.  Yeah, stunning.', '2022-01-22 11:01:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7712460, 1267305, 173844, '<td valign="top">And they say you can''t transmute base into gold.  It''s all gold, so what''s the issue?  Lovingly seen and offered.</td>', 'And they say you can''t transmute base into gold.  It''s all gold, so what''s the issue?  Lovingly seen and offered.', '2022-01-22 11:04:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7712462, 1266769, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fabulous, thrilling.  It''s really perfect.  Love it.</td>', 'Fabulous, thrilling.  It''s really perfect.  Love it.', '2022-01-22 11:08:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7712463, 1267495, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  The composition, varied shapes, lines and textures and cozy palette work seamlessly, harmoniously, together.  Reminiscent of Edward Hopper''s painting, "Early Sunday Morning."</td>', 'Lovely image.  The composition, varied shapes, lines and textures and cozy palette work seamlessly, harmoniously, together.  Reminiscent of Edward Hopper''s painting, "Early Sunday Morning."', '2022-01-22 11:16:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7712464, 1267512, 173844, '<td valign="top">Cleverly, wonderfully framed.</td>', 'Cleverly, wonderfully framed.', '2022-01-22 11:18:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7712465, 1267380, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  The off focus and heavy grain are completely untroubling, lending credence to the fairy tale mood.  Fine, noble hero, soon to lift off to adventure.  Serene unfolding of blues, sea, mountains, sky.  Capable middle ground, that strip of land and the buildings.  The foreground gull and the background mountains and sky settle the classic composition.  Appreciating the ever so subtle play of pink.  Something magical about this.</td>', 'Lovely image.  The off focus and heavy grain are completely untroubling, lending credence to the fairy tale mood.  Fine, noble hero, soon to lift off to adventure.  Serene unfolding of blues, sea, mountains, sky.  Capable middle ground, that strip of land and the buildings.  The foreground gull and the background mountains and sky settle the classic composition.  Appreciating the ever so subtle play of pink.  Something magical about this.', '2022-01-22 11:30:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7712466, 1267442, 173844, '<td valign="top">Don''s comment says it all.  Thanks for so often moving us, showing the way.</td>', 'Don''s comment says it all.  Thanks for so often moving us, showing the way.', '2022-01-22 11:33:03.000000', NULL, 0),
